    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1814890/extras/fb954ca8882b9469b9463a9c5a7145ef.poster.avif?t=1750674536\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1814890/extras/fb954ca8882b9469b9463a9c5a7145ef.webm?t=1750674536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1814890/extras/fb954ca8882b9469b9463a9c5a7145ef.mp4?t=1750674536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1814890/extras/e8caf98de4c446eb8efee68ce49c67e7.webp?t=1750674536\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Accompany agent <strong>Steph</strong>, right hand of the revered forbidden flower, </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">on the hunt for their final rival residing in the beautiful and glamorous </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">casino, the <strong>Casa De Diamantes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1814890/extras/d97a12fe9e877d2037d51c2558215d54.poster.avif?t=1750674536\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1814890/extras/d97a12fe9e877d2037d51c2558215d54.webm?t=1750674536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Casa De Diamantes</strong> is a <strong>2D movement shooter</strong> with aggressive enemy </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">encounters and tight level design. Fight your way through multiple enemy </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">types, collect chips then spend and gamble them away at the casino. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Play blackjack, customize your appearance or decorate your hotel room </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">at the Casa De Diamantes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1814890/extras/a45a514074ad261552a1aedab43ff631.poster.avif?t=1750674536\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1814890/extras/a45a514074ad261552a1aedab43ff631.webm?t=1750674536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1814890/extras/a45a514074ad261552a1aedab43ff631.mp4?t=1750674536\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1814890/extras/5305e12b881a9582a70025cbbb4ad942.poster.avif?t=1750674536\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1814890/extras/5305e12b881a9582a70025cbbb4ad942.webm?t=1750674536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div> Momentum Based Movement</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1814890/extras/5305e12b881a9582a70025cbbb4ad942.poster.avif?t=1750674536\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1814890/extras/5305e12b881a9582a70025cbbb4ad942.webm?t=1750674536\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></div> Dangerous Enemies with unique Attack Patterns</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_im